(Q2 - Sequential Search Engineering Decision \(4 Marks\)) Tj
50 671.0 Td
(======================================================) Tj
50 658.0 Td
(Problem: Tool-tracking system asks "Who has Tool T-184?" using sequential search.) Tj
50 645.0 Td
() Tj
50 632.0 Td
() Tj
50 619.0 Td
(ALGORITHM: SequentialSearch\(A[0..n-1], target\)) Tj
50 606.0 Td
(-----------------------------------------------) Tj
50 593.0 Td
(// Search for target by examining each element from left to right) Tj
50 580.0 Td
(// Input : Array A of n elements, search key target) Tj
50 567.0 Td
(// Output: Index of target \(or -1 if not found\), comparison count) Tj
50 554.0 Td
() Tj
50 541.0 Td
(  comparisons <- 0) Tj
50 528.0 Td
(  FOR i <- 0 TO n-1 DO) Tj
50 515.0 Td
(      comparisons <- comparisons + 1) Tj
50 502.0 Td
(      IF A[i] = target THEN) Tj
50 489.0 Td
(          RETURN i, comparisons           // Successful: found at position i) Tj
50 476.0 Td
(      END IF) Tj
50 463.0 Td
(  END FOR) Tj
50 450.0 Td
(  RETURN -1, comparisons                 // Unsuccessful: not in array) Tj
50 437.0 Td
() Tj
50 424.0 Td
(Step-by-Step Logic:) Tj
50 411.0 Td
(  1. Start at index 0.) Tj
50 398.0 Td
(  2. Compare current element with target.) Tj
50 385.0 Td
(  3. If match: return index and comparison count immediately.) Tj
50 372.0 Td
(  4. If no match: move to next element.) Tj
50 359.0 Td
(  5. If end of array reached without match: return -1.) Tj
50 346.0 Td
() Tj
50 333.0 Td
() Tj
50 320.0 Td
