50 268.0 Td
(    comparisons = p + 1) Tj
50 255.0 Td
() Tj
50 242.0 Td
(    Position  | Comparisons | % of n) Tj
50 229.0 Td
(    ----------+-------------+-------) Tj
50 216.0 Td
(    First \(0\) |      1      |  1/n) Tj
50 203.0 Td
(    Middle    |    n/2      |  50%) Tj
50 190.0 Td
(    Last      |     n       | 100%) Tj
50 177.0 Td
() Tj
